750411,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21585,"speakerName":"ショヴィニェ","textMapHash":2882295506,"text":"ありがとう、二人とも！あんたらがいなきゃ、オレはまだ下の洞窟で引きこもってただろうな。","nextNodeIds":[790750412]},{"nodeId":790750412,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21585,"speakerName":"ショヴィニェ","textMapHash":320055338,"text":"今なら本心をあらいざらいパニュールに話せるぜ。","nextNodeIds":[790750413]},{"nodeId":790750413,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21449,"speakerName":"パニュール","textMapHash":341647274,"text":"いつでも君の話を聞くよ、ショヴィニェ。旅のことでも、植木鉢のことでも…なんでも。","nextNodeIds":[790750414]},{"nodeId":790750414,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21449,"speakerName":"パニュール","textMapHash":604001986,"text":"そうだ、二人とも。これを受け取ってくれ。時間をかけて集めてきたものなんだ。","nextNodeIds":[790750415]},{"nodeId":790750415,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21449,"speakerName":"パニュール","textMapHash":2520804834,"text":"女神様のご加護があらんことを。友達とケンカすることがありませんように…それから、話を聞いてくれる人が常に傍にいますように。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":790750410,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3438018538,"text":"解決したならそれでいい。","nextNodeIds":[790750411]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7907504,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["100","610008082,3"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REFRESH_GROUP_SUITE"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["100","610008083,2"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REFRESH_GROUP_SUITE"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["100","610008084,2"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REFRESH_GROUP_SUITE"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds